381798060"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-center gf-elm-center-lg gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><h2 class="gf_gs-text-heading-2"><b>空気をまとう近未来　～Flare～</b></h2></div></div><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1630993781106" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1630993781106"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en" data-exc=""><p>2030年のネクストスタンダードダウンを考える、KAPOK KNOTのコレクションシリーズ「Plant-Based Down 2030:Gathering」。表地から中綿、縫い糸に至るまですべてが植物由来100%のダウンコートが、2030年の世界ではスタンダードになっているのではないか？という考えから、最先端の技術を組み合わせてコートをデザイン。</p><p><br></p><p>Flareは、その名の通り裾と袖の独特なフレアデザインが特徴。</p><p>ギャザーとフレアが絶妙なバランスの融合しつつ、絶妙な丈感でスカートやパンツの良さも活かすた至極の逸品。特別な日の1着に。</p><p><br></p><p>1枚目モデル身長：178cm</p><p>2枚目以降モデル身長：162cm</p><p><br></p><p><br></p></div></div></div><div class="gf_clearfix"></div>{% unless product == empty %}{% for variant in product.variants %}<input type="hidden" id="gf-hidden-variant{{variant.id}}" value="{{variant.id}}" data-compare-price="{{ variant.compare_at_price | money | strip_html }}" data-price="{{ variant.price | money | strip_html }}">{% endfor %}<script type="text/plain" class="product-json" id="product-json{{product.id}}">{{ product | json }}</script>{% endunless %}{% endform %}{% endunless %}</div>{% assign product = currentProduct %}</div><div data-label="Accordion" data-key="accordion" id="m-1611382311548" class="module-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-accordion" data-ver="2" data-id="1611382311548"><div data-accordion-group="" class="module " data-opendefault="1" data-opentab="1" data-single="1" data-bordercolor="#cecece" data-bordersize="1px"><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="1" data-key="content" class="chevron iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1611388897008" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-id="1611388897008" data-ver="1"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-exc=""><p><b>サイズ詳細</b></p></div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="1" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Image" data-key="image" data-atomgroup="element" id="e-1696812259221" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-image" data-ver="1.0" data-id="1696812259221" data-resolution="3000x3000"><div class="elm gf-elm-center gf_elm-left-xs gf-elm-center-md gf-elm-center-sm gf-elm-center-xs gf-elm-center-lg" data-exc=""><img src="https://ucarecdn.com/33c2c457-9a66-4396-8515-0faa709c1da4/-/format/auto/-/preview/3000x3000/-/quality/lighter/23AW%20%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A7%E3%83%BC%E3%83%92%E3%82%9A%E3%83%BC%E3%82%B903.png" alt="" class="gf_image" data-gemlang="en" width="1920" height="1272" data-width="100%" data-height="auto" title=""></div></div></article></div></div><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="2" data-key="content" class="chevron iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1611382311548-1" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-id="1611382311548-1" data-ver="1"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-exc=""><p><b>素材</b></p></div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="2" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1611382369227" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1611382369227"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en">表地：ナイロン100%<div>中綿：テンセル56％、植物繊維（カポック）44％</div><div>裏地：キュプラ100％</div></div></div></article></div></div><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="3" data-key="content" class="chevron iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1644417164043" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-id="1644417164043" data-ver="1"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-exc=""><p><b>カーボンフットプリント</b></p></div></div><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button><button type="button" class="wrapp-icon"><span class="acc-icon" style="background-color:#000000"></span></button></div><div data-content="" style="margin-top: ; background-color: #FFFFFF"><article data-index="3" data-key="content1" class="item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" data-key="text-block" id="e-1644417164058" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-ver="1" data-id="1644417164058"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-gemlang="en"><p>カーボンフットプリントは10.46kg-CO2です。</p><p><br></p><p>KAPOK KNOTは素材、製造、消費者の使用によるカーボンフットプリントを算出しています。</p><p></p></div></div></article></div></div><div data-accordion="" style="padding-bottom: "><div data-control="" data-index="4" data-key="content" class="chevron iCon-right text- item-content"><div data-label="Text Block" id="e-1611382311548-2" class="element-wrap" data-icon="gpicon-textblock" data-id="1611382311548-2" data-ver="1"><div class="elm text-edit gf-elm-left-lg gf-elm-left-md gf-elm-left-sm gf-elm-left-xs gf_gs-text-paragraph-1" data-exc=""><p><b>お手入れ方法</b></p></div><